Synveil desktop runtime packaging notice

This package contains the Synveil desktop shell, the separately supervised
Synveil background client, Linux desktop integration metadata, and the
user-level systemd service definition. The package does not contain user
credentials, database credentials, or administrator configuration.

Qt and CXX-Qt runtime licensing/notices are supplied by the distribution's
corresponding Qt runtime packages. This manifest does not package proprietary
Qt modules.
